msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"(A man out drinking in the Champion District, huh? This must\r\n"
"be none other than Violence Tobita. He's certainly big enough\r\n"
"to be a bouncer.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"(He's sleeping so peacefully, though... I should just let\r\n"
"him be.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Hey, wake up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Huh...? The hell do you want..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "I'm Kiryu. I was hoping we could talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"See, I'm working for a casino, and right now we're looking\r\n"
"for bouncers. I was thinking I could recruit you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"A bouncer? I'm a pro wrestler, man. Why would I wanna\r\n"
"downgrade to something like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Well, I heard you hurt your back and were gonna retire.\r\n"
"Something along those lines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"What!? That's just some bullshit my manager is saying!\r\n"
"It's my body anyway⑬I oughta know it best, don't ya think!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"C'mon! I'll prove it to you! I've still got plenty of gas\r\n"
"left in the tank!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Go ahead and try me! If you can knock me out, I'll bow out\r\n"
"gracefully and become your bouncer. I put that on my pride\r\n"
"as a wrestler!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"(I bet I could wait here all day and he still wouldn't wake\r\n"
"up... \"Hibernation\" Tobita's more like it.)"
msgstr ""

